    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「マオ。おいでおいで……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「いつもは忙しくて、あまりかまってあげられてないですから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「精いっぱい、かわいがってあげますね。にゃ～ん、にゃん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「むぅ。『マオ』だとあまり反応してくれないですぅ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「やっぱり名前がみっつあるのが問題みたいですね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「お父さんもお母さんも……それぞれ、マオに呼びたい名前を付けちゃいましたから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
